{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/d80382293f2d6db71c5b029ce2888c6f.avif?t=1765965672\" width=512 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra-7</strong> is a business simulation game set on an alien planet, inspired by management games like <i>Two Point Hospital</i> and colony sims like <i>RimWorld</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a company to extract, process, and sell resources, while taking care of your employees\u2019 needs and facing the dangers of a complex alien ecosystem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire employees to grow your company!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New hires will be attracted by high salaries and quality of life: to keep them happy, you\u2019ll need to provide housing, food, and recreational services\u2014building a self-sufficient city around them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your company from threats or your employees will start to worry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A real-time atmospheric simulation moves toxic fumes and smog across the map with the wind: use mountains as natural defenses or build artificial barriers to help your community thrive in safety!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721470?t=1765965672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/b098615ce110c1335ad59536449873087bb22dba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765965672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/c602f08cc54dab13b11ff6b93b0b7087ea94fc7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765965672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/c602f08cc54dab13b11ff6b93b0b7087ea94fc7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765965672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/d80382293f2d6db71c5b029ce2888c6f.avif?t=1765965672\" width=512 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra-7</strong> is a business simulation game set on an alien planet, inspired by management games like <i>Two Point Hospital</i> and colony sims like <i>RimWorld</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a company to extract, process, and sell resources, while taking care of your employees\u2019 needs and facing the dangers of a complex alien ecosystem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire employees to grow your company!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New hires will be attracted by high salaries and quality of life: to keep them happy, you\u2019ll need to provide housing, food, and recreational services\u2014building a self-sufficient city around them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your company from threats or your employees will start to worry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A real-time atmospheric simulation moves toxic fumes and smog across the map with the wind: use mountains as natural defenses or build artificial barriers to help your community thrive in safety!</p>","developers":["Gamyeon"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/74dfca0705ab51aff43f50992d3233addfe2963e/header.jpg?t=1765965672","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<